  "bio": "Shivang Monga is a director at 1st December Films who brings a sharp eye for everyday Indian behaviour: humour, warmth and performance-driven storytelling. His work across leading brands including CARS24, IGP, Britannia Good Day, Titan, BigBasket, Cipla and Razorpay reflects a strong instinct for capturing simple human moments that connect instantly and leave a lasting impression. As part of the creative team at 1st December Films, Shivang continues to craft culture-rich, character-led and sharply observed films that combine authentic storytelling with strong visual execution.",
