 {
  "slug": "ganesh-pareek",
  "name": "Ganesh Pareek",
  "bio": "Ganesh Pareek is partner, executive producer and creative director at First December Films, and winner of the Cannes Gold Lion and Cannes Glass Lion. He is counted among the top television commercial producers in the world. Trained at DDB and then Mudra Calcutta, he has produced virtually the entire First December Films slate, from Nike 'Make Every Yard Count' and 'Beauty Tips by Reshma' to Google, Meta, Vivo, KFC and Star Sports. In 2023 he directed the feature film Manu. He teaches film appreciation at the Film and Television Institute of India (FTII) Pune and at Xavier Institute of Communications (XIC) Mumbai, and has shared stages with Grammy-winning musicians as an expert speaker.",
  "credits": [
   {
